\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1
\pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 RootRecord Partner Print Packet\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Apps, Services, Local Media, Custom Digital Products, and Partner Intake Forms\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Prepared for prospective partners, advertisers, content holders, creators, community organizations, and businesses interested in custom RootRecord-built applications.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 This packet is designed for in-person briefings. It includes a product overview, partnership options, custom application planning pages, intake forms, meeting notes, and lightweight draft agreement templates. Legal templates are starting points only and should be reviewed by an attorney before use as binding documents.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 RootRecord\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Practical apps for local communities, businesses, and real-world decisions\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord builds focused mobile apps, web dashboards, cloud systems, and custom digital tools for people who need useful information in the moment. The work is designed around a simple idea: software should make important information easier to find, easier to understand, and easier to act on.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord products connect users to weather, alerts, local conditions, business workflows, media, memberships, submissions, dashboards, notifications, and account-based services. Each app is designed to feel simple on the surface while being supported by serious cloud infrastructure underneath.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord is especially interested in partnerships where technology can strengthen local reach. That includes local content creators, businesses, landowners, tourism operators, media holders, community groups, educators, nonprofits, advertisers, and organizations that want a custom app built around a specific audience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The current ecosystem includes:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Kilauea Alerts, a Hawai\u\ui Island and Kilauea-focused conditions app\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Weather Manager, a broader weather and alert companion\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Business Manager, a mobile-first business organization tool\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Account Hub, a central account and membership experience\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Custom-built mobile and web applications for special orders\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Cloud dashboards, content portals, APIs, feedback systems, and notification tools\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord does not build throwaway landing pages or generic template apps. The focus is on systems that can grow: public websites, Android releases, member dashboards, Cloudflare-backed APIs, admin tools, data feeds, media galleries, and app experiences that can be expanded over time.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 For the right partner, RootRecord can help turn local knowledge, original content, specialized data, or a business process into a polished digital product.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Kilauea Alerts\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 A focused app for Hawai\u\ui Island, Kilauea, and volcano-related awareness\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Kilauea Alerts is one of RootRecord's most important public products. It is built for Hawai\u\ui Island residents, visitors, volcano watchers, content creators, local businesses, and anyone who wants a focused way to follow Kilauea-related conditions from one place.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The app brings together official-source context and mobile-friendly presentation so users do not have to jump between multiple websites, feeds, maps, and alert pages. Kilauea Alerts is not an official government app and does not replace emergency agencies. Its value is in helping users follow the right signals, recognize what changed, and know which official source to check next.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Kilauea Alerts currently includes:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab USGS and HVO Kilauea volcano notices\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Hawai\u\ui-region earthquake activity\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab National Weather Service Hawai\u\ui alerts\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Weather and forecast context\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Air quality information\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Live feed links for volcano watching\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Kilauea photo gallery and submissions\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab AI-assisted hazard summaries based on official-source context\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Android access through Google Play\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Member web dashboard access for larger-screen use\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 For local partners, Kilauea Alerts creates several practical opportunities. A creator with volcano footage, photography, local commentary, educational content, or visitor-facing material can reach an audience already interested in Kilauea. A business near Volcano, Hilo, Puna, Kona, or Hawai\u\ui Volcanoes National Park can place itself near a highly relevant audience. A content holder with cameras, media archives, or local feeds can turn that content into a more useful public experience.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Kilauea Alerts is designed to be serious, calm, and useful. It avoids hype. It respects official agencies. It gives users context without pretending to be an emergency authority. That makes it a strong base for responsible local partnerships.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Partnership Opportunities\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Advertising, content placement, creator collaboration, and local visibility\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord is looking for partners who want more than a simple banner ad. The best partnerships combine audience, context, and usefulness.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Kilauea Alerts is a natural home for local visibility because the audience is already focused on Hawai\u\ui Island conditions, volcano activity, travel planning, weather, photography, education, and safety-adjacent awareness. This creates a strong match for partners such as:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Local tour operators\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Lodging and hospitality businesses\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Photographers and videographers\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Local guides and educators\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Outdoor and visitor-focused businesses\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Hawai\u\ui Island creators\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Museums, galleries, and cultural organizations\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Equipment, preparedness, or outdoor brands\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Local media and camera feed holders\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Community organizations with public information to distribute\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Potential partnership formats include:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Sponsored placement inside a relevant app section\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Local business visibility on web or Android surfaces\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Sponsored educational content\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Featured camera, live feed, or media source links\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Photo gallery partnerships\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Content licensing or attribution partnerships\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Sponsored release posts and community announcements\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Co-branded informational pages\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Custom landing pages connected to app traffic\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Push or in-app announcement campaigns where appropriate and non-intrusive\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord's goal is to keep advertising useful and relevant. A good placement should feel connected to what the user is already doing. For example, a Volcano-area business belongs naturally near Kilauea content. A creator with Kilauea footage belongs near live feeds or media. A local educator belongs near explainers and official-source context.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord is especially interested in working with people who already have trusted local knowledge or original media. RootRecord can provide the app infrastructure, dashboard, and user experience around that content.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 RootRecord Apps and Services\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 A growing suite of practical tools\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 While Kilauea Alerts is a major focus, RootRecord is not a single-app project. It is a product ecosystem built around mobile access, cloud services, account features, and custom digital workflows.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Weather Manager\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Weather Manager is a broader weather-focused app for users who want current conditions, forecasts, alerts, air quality, saved locations, and mobile weather tools. It is useful for people who want more flexible location-based weather monitoring beyond the Kilauea-specific use case.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Weather Manager is a strong fit for broader weather partnerships, regional content, local preparedness messaging, and future sponsored weather-related placements.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Business Manager\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Business Manager is designed for small business owners, independent operators, freelancers, and teams that need mobile access to business organization tools. It supports RootRecord's broader service direction: practical apps that help users run real workflows without a heavy enterprise system.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Business Manager also demonstrates RootRecord's ability to build product-specific tools for a defined audience. That same approach can be applied to a partner's custom operations, bookings, inventory, field reporting, media submissions, staff coordination, or customer dashboards.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Account Hub\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Account Hub provides a central account and membership experience across RootRecord products. It supports sign-in, account visibility, billing-related workflows, app associations, and the broader user relationship.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Custom Applications\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord can build special-order applications for partners who need a specific digital product. Examples include:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A mobile app for a local brand or creator\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A private dashboard for staff or members\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A public information portal\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A media submission and moderation system\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A business workflow tracker\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A location-based information app\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A custom alert or notification tool\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A content library with paid or member access\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The value is not only in building an app. The value is in building the app, the backend, the account flow, the deployment path, the update process, and the ability to keep improving it.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Why RootRecord\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Local relevance with real technical capability\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord is positioned between two worlds: local, practical usefulness and full-stack software engineering. That combination matters.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Many businesses and creators have valuable content, knowledge, or audience trust, but no app infrastructure. Many developers can build software, but do not understand how to package it into a local product with a clear audience. RootRecord brings both sides together.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord can help partners:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Turn local expertise into a polished app experience\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Reach a relevant audience through existing products\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Build a custom app without managing the whole technical stack\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Add content, media, or business workflows to a cloud-backed platform\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Create member-only or public access experiences\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Launch Android apps through Google Play\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Build web dashboards and landing pages\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Integrate feedback, forms, galleries, and notifications\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Develop a roadmap instead of a one-time website\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord services can include:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Product planning and feature scoping\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab App design and user experience\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Android app development\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Web dashboard development\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Cloudflare Worker API development\par
