\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Authentication and account systems\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Media gallery and content workflows\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Admin tools and moderation\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Release management and app store preparation\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Ongoing improvements and support\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 For advertisers, RootRecord offers context. For content holders, RootRecord offers distribution and structure. For local businesses, RootRecord offers visibility. For special-order clients, RootRecord offers a path from idea to working product.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 The most valuable partnerships are long-term. RootRecord can start with a simple placement, content feature, or landing page, then grow into deeper integration over time.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sa260\par
