\page \pard\plain\f1\fs40\b\sa320 Working With RootRecord\b0\par
\pard\plain\f1\fs34\b\sa260 Turn audience, content, or operations into a real app experience\b0\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord is looking for conversations with people and organizations that have something meaningful to bring to a focused digital product.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 You may be a good fit if you have:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Local knowledge people rely on\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Original photos, videos, or live feeds\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A business that serves the Kilauea, Volcano, Hawai\u\ui Island, or visitor audience\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A community that needs better information tools\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A workflow that is still being managed through messages, spreadsheets, or paper\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A brand that would benefit from its own mobile or web app\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab A specialized audience that deserves a cleaner digital experience\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Possible first steps:\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Sponsor a section or release announcement\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Add a partner link or featured content placement\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Explore a content licensing or attribution arrangement\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Build a custom landing page\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Scope a custom mobile app\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Create a dashboard for your audience or staff\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\li540\fi-300\sa150 \bullet\tab Start with a pilot and expand after feedback\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 RootRecord's pitch is simple: if the audience is real, the need is clear, and the content or service has value, RootRecord can help turn it into a product.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 Kilauea Alerts is already live on Google Play and gives RootRecord a strong local foundation. Weather Manager, Business Manager, Account Hub, and custom app development expand that foundation into a broader service offering.\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa220\par
\pard\plain\f0\fs28\sl360\slmult1\sa180 For partners, this means RootRecord is not only offering ad space. RootRecord offers a path to build useful digital infrastructure around your audience.\par
